# Machines through the real keys, on a normal seed-1 coast at late morning:
# telegraphs read, a dodge through a bite, a blow ringing off plate, a real hit
# on a working part, a grip and the pull free. The tour waits on what a player
# would see (await) and fails if it never comes.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/fight.tour --seed=1 --hour=11
zoom 11
# The scripted meetings only: no worker on its round or first runner wandering in.
coast calm
# A runner: its working part is at its back, so met face on it is all plate.
spawn runner
await tell 4
shot 01-runner-tell with mob:runner
tap dodge
wait 0.08
shot 02-dodge-through-the-bite with mob:runner
try 5
walkto mob 1.5
tap swing
await ring 1.5
end
wait 0.05
shot 03-blow-rings-off-plate with mob:runner
# Away from it (far past its tether), to a watcher out in a field.
# The coordinate stays; tours/machines-day.tour says why, at its own copy of it.
at 135,375
wait 1.5
spawn watcher
wait 0.6
walkto mob 2
shot 04-up-to-the-watchers-lens with mob:watcher
try 5
walkto mob 1
tap swing
await hit 1.5
end
wait 0.04
shot 05-real-hit-on-the-working-part with mob:watcher
tap swing
wait 0.5
tap swing
wait 0.6
shot 06-watcher-after with body:watcher
# A lineman's hook: stand in its reach through the tell, and it takes hold;
# then pull (swing) until it lets go.
at 160,352
wait 1.5
spawn lineman
# A lineman is a worker: it is left be until struck, then it turns on you. On
# its round it walks on (and goes round a player in its way), so catch it up.
try 4
walkto mob 2
tap swing
await tell 6
end
shot 07-lineman-tell with mob:lineman
try 4
walkto mob 0.5
await grip 4
end
wait 0.1
shot 08-gripped with grip
tap swing
wait 0.2
tap swing
wait 0.2
tap swing
wait 0.2
tap swing
await free 4
wait 0.1
shot 09-pulled-free with free
# The harvester's long tell, read from outside its reach, on the first coast.
place spawn
wait 1.5
spawn harvester
# Indifferent on its round: struck in its blades it turns, and tells.
try 4
walkto mob 2
tap swing
await tell 8
end
shot 10-harvester-tell with mob:harvester
tap dodge
wait 0.1
shot 11-out-of-the-row with mob:harvester
